    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa8<strong>Make your Dio!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build, customize, and share your own unique creations!<br>Use an ever-growing collection of objects to craft anything you can imagine.<br>Upload your creations to the Steam Workshop for others to explore and enjoy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378950/extras/e83eb867d18c0a766b657437e8c97ade.poster.avif?t=1754384672\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378950/extras/e83eb867d18c0a766b657437e8c97ade.webm?t=1754384672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378950/extras/e83eb867d18c0a766b657437e8c97ade.mp4?t=1754384672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf08<strong>Go into detail!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything is customizable, down to the tiniest details! (If you want it to be)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378950/extras/19fe564a9da9751581e3aaa1ebe78e50.poster.avif?t=1754384672\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378950/extras/19fe564a9da9751581e3aaa1ebe78e50.webm?t=1754384672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378950/extras/19fe564a9da9751581e3aaa1ebe78e50.mp4?t=1754384672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2728Find and collect</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and collect creatures called <strong>Rumi</strong> just by playing!<br>If you're a Twitch streamer, your viewers can collect Rumi too \u2014 they'll explore your creations live on stream!<br>And once the <strong>Rumi-Store</strong> opens, you'll be able to feed them, play with them, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378950/extras/3529c15894f42d28cf0ccaa803952057.poster.avif?t=1754384672\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378950/extras/3529c15894f42d28cf0ccaa803952057.webm?t=1754384672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378950/extras/3529c15894f42d28cf0ccaa803952057.mp4?t=1754384672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae<strong>Take control</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take direct control of a Rumi and jump, run, and explore rooms and levels \u2014 whether you made them or downloaded them from others!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378950/extras/d0d8954556fb2c2f4e2ee9aa079a6d69.poster.avif?t=1754384672\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378950/extras/d0d8954556fb2c2f4e2ee9aa079a6d69.webm?t=1754384672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378950/extras/d0d8954556fb2c2f4e2ee9aa079a6d69.mp4?t=1754384672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf81<strong>Early Access Gifts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play during Early Access and receive an exclusive gift!<br>(The contents of which will be unobtainable after Early Access ends)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378950/extras/392ca9930c6b8d7bbfd031850c0cf6be.poster.avif?t=1754384672\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378950/extras/392ca9930c6b8d7bbfd031850c0cf6be.webm?t=1754384672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378950/extras/392ca9930c6b8d7bbfd031850c0cf6be.mp4?t=1754384672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa8<strong>Make your Dio!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build, customize, and share your own unique creations!<br>Use an ever-growing collection of objects to craft anything you can imagine.<br>Upload your creations to the Steam Workshop for others to explore and enjoy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378950/extras/e83eb867d18c0a766b657437e8c97ade.poster.avif?t=1754384672\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378950/extras/e83eb867d18c0a766b657437e8c97ade.webm?t=1754384672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378950/extras/e83eb867d18c0a766b657437e8c97ade.mp4?t=1754384672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf08<strong>Go into detail!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything is customizable, down to the tiniest details! (If you want it to be)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378950/extras/19fe564a9da9751581e3aaa1ebe78e50.poster.avif?t=1754384672\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378950/extras/19fe564a9da9751581e3aaa1ebe78e50.webm?t=1754384672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378950/extras/19fe564a9da9751581e3aaa1ebe78e50.mp4?t=1754384672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2728Find and collect</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and collect creatures called <strong>Rumi</strong> just by playing!<br>If you're a Twitch streamer, your viewers can collect Rumi too \u2014 they'll explore your creations live on stream!<br>And once the <strong>Rumi-Store</strong> opens, you'll be able to feed them, play with them, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378950/extras/3529c15894f42d28cf0ccaa803952057.poster.avif?t=1754384672\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378950/extras/3529c15894f42d28cf0ccaa803952057.webm?t=1754384672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378950/extras/3529c15894f42d28cf0ccaa803952057.mp4?t=1754384672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae<strong>Take control</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take direct control of a Rumi and jump, run, and explore rooms and levels \u2014 whether you made them or downloaded them from others!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378950/extras/d0d8954556fb2c2f4e2ee9aa079a6d69.poster.avif?t=1754384672\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378950/extras/d0d8954556fb2c2f4e2ee9aa079a6d69.webm?t=1754384672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378950/extras/d0d8954556fb2c2f4e2ee9aa079a6d69.mp4?t=1754384672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udf81<strong>Early Access Gifts</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play during Early Access and receive an exclusive gift!<br>(The contents of which will be unobtainable after Early Access ends)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378950/extras/392ca9930c6b8d7bbfd031850c0cf6be.poster.avif?t=1754384672\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378950/extras/392ca9930c6b8d7bbfd031850c0cf6be.webm?t=1754384672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3378950/extras/392ca9930c6b8d7bbfd031850c0cf6be.mp4?t=1754384672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "In MiDiO! you can decorate your own cozy slice of a room. Collect cute creatures that roam around and play inside your creations! Or, take control of one yourself and explore other players' DIO rooms! Streaming on Twitch? Connect your Twitch account and let your viewers collect some too!",
